        "title": "P1: LSP.AppAddresses writes the readable address, spell:/@spell/... (encodeURI, # and ? escaped), as the scope packs and the docs spell it, not Monaco's spell:/%40spell/...; pathOf() reads either, so Monaco's models (made by Uri.parse) and the language service agree. <spell-editor>'s pending-selection check now compares paths, not URI strings.",
